[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3120.63, "timestamp": "00:52:00", "text": "私の第一言語です。ええ、でもそうですね、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3123.99, "timestamp": "00:52:03", "text": "彼らが注文できるように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3126.87, "timestamp": "00:52:06", "text": "彼らが守るために"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3129.589, "timestamp": "00:52:09", "text": "体育会系に壊されることから自分たち自身を守るために、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3133.03, "timestamp": "00:52:13", "text": "卵型ショットガンが必要だ。そしてモモ、ありがとう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3149.109, "timestamp": "00:52:29", "text": "彼らは私をキャンセルした、実際には"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3152.309, "timestamp": "00:52:32", "text": "性別を間違えたり、間違った代名詞を追加したりする。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3155.109, "timestamp": "00:52:35", "text": "キャンセルしようとしたことはありますか？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3157.58, "timestamp": "00:52:37", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lmaoo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3157.87, "timestamp": "00:52:37", "text": "私とか、そういう類のもの？いいえ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3161.43, "timestamp": "00:52:41", "text": "右。ただの覚醒剤ですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3162.19, "timestamp": "00:52:42", "text": "私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3167.03, "timestamp": "00:52:47", "text": "つまり、私は怒鳴られたことがあるんです。おい、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3174.069, "timestamp": "00:52:54", "text": "えー、実は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3175.829, "timestamp": "00:52:55", "text": "さてさて、実はこういうことなんです。場合によります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3178.069, "timestamp": "00:52:58", "text": "あなたがカウンセリングで何を見つけるか。せいぜい、"}]